<title>USA: Merrill wins State of Maryland $240 mln GO bonds.</title>
<headline>Merrill wins State of Maryland $240 mln GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it won $240 million of State of Maryland general obligation bonds, state and local facilities loan of 1997, First Series, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 4.90 percent.</p>
</text>
